From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sun Yuechi <sunyuechi@iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:46:05 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] python/mcp: build the tools from the RPC schema

7c0720d ("python/rpc: remove deprecated python modules") deleted
python/spdk/rpc/bdev.py, but the MCP server still imports it, so the
installed spdk-mcp fails at import time.

Register one tool per RPC method from schema/schema.yaml instead -- the
same source the CLI is generated from. The schema is shipped in the wheel,
the 'mcp' extra now pulls pyyaml, and a missing schema fails at startup.

Change-Id: I526065a197defefd60ff20fbcd8c5e8bf4465efb
Signed-off-by: Sun Yuechi <sunyuechi@iscas.ac.cn>
---
 python/pyproject.toml     |  5 ++-
 python/spdk/mcp/server.py | 93 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 88 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

